  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Bake chips: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Cut the unpeeled potatoes into 1cm-thick chips. Put the potato on the lined tray, drizzle with 2 tsp olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden and tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1944028/photos/large/119779_1-7b6f87c4d96092194a19685e2f503a3d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Meanwhile, coarsely chop the lettuce and tomato. Finely chop the cucumber. Crush ½ garlic clove (see Make it yours).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1944029/photos/large/119779_2-ad32e2b36bbd454ef0ba9c2042a8965f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook falafel: Heat 1 tbs olive oil in a medium frypan over medium-high heat. Fry the falafel, turning regularly, for 3-5 mins until golden. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1944030/photos/large/119779_3-8bb959ef8aab73558721c148aa939753.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make salad and tzatziki: Combine 2 tsp olive oil and 2 tsp white wine vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the lettuce and tomato and toss to combine. Combine the cucumber, garlic and yoghurt in a separate bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1944031/photos/large/119779_4-60134c03a0727ba2a1568e26a988b60f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the chips, salad and falafel among plates. Drizzle with the barbecue sauce and serve with the tzatziki. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1944032/photos/large/119779_5-f568bdcbf838aa2f30bc9a23bc1a763f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Kids not keen on raw garlic? Simply leave it out of the tzatziki.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1944033/photos/large/119779_6-f8177220971b5de03d8d4b8dddcb5817.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
